# ==============================================================================
# POCKETBOT APEX — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: PocketBot Apex runs 100% OUT-OF-THE-BOX with MetaTrader 5 Demo and $0 AI
# token cost in Pure Math mode WITHOUT needing this file or any API keys!
#
# If you want to enable Google Gemini AI Veto, cTrader Open API, or Telegram
# remote control, copy this file to ".env" in the same folder and fill in your keys:
#
#   copy .env.example .env
#
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. GOOGLE GEMINI AI RISK VETO (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your free Gemini API key in 10 seconds at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# If unset, PocketBot Apex automatically falls back to local Google AI Pro (agy.exe)
# if installed, or deterministic quantitative Pure Math mode (0ms, $0 token cost).
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. CTRADER OPEN API / FUSION MARKETS (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Free cTrader Open API credentials from: https://openapi.ctrader.com
# TIP: You can simply double-click "1_SETUP_CTRADER_KEYS.bat" and the automated
# wizard will guide you through connecting your account in 60 seconds!
#
# CTRADER_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
# CTRADER_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
# CTRADER_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_oauth_access_token_here
# CTRADER_REFRESH_TOKEN=your_oauth_refresh_token_here
# CTRADER_ACCOUNT_ID=1234567

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. TELEGRAM REMOTE COCKPIT & NOTIFICATIONS (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Create a free bot on Telegram by messaging @BotFather to get your BOT TOKEN.
# Find your personal CHAT ID by messaging @userinfobot on Telegram.
#
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:ABCdefGhIJKlmNoPQRsTUVwxyZ
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=123456789

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. SAFETY INVARIANT: LIVE ACCOUNT UNLOCK GUARD (Default: Hard-Locked to DEMO)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PocketBot Apex is hard-locked to DEMO accounts by default.
# Real money live trading is strictly prevented unless BOTH:
#   1. The "--unlock-live" command-line flag is passed at launch, AND
#   2. APEX_UNLOCK_LIVE=I_ACCEPT_REAL_RISK is explicitly set below.
#
# APEX_UNLOCK_LIVE=I_ACCEPT_REAL_RISK
